export anchor AlignItems:
    description:
        Sets the default alignment of all children along the cross axis of a flex container.

    identifier: alignItems

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `align-items` property.

    values:
        - `stretch`
        - `flex-start`
        - `flex-end`
        - `center`
        - `baseline`

    initial: stretch

    appliesTo: Flex containers.

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            alignItems: center
        \\\
        ```
